<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ลืมรหัสผ่าน — BizFlow</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #f97316;
      --glass-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      --text-main: #1a1a1a;
      --text-muted: #5f5f5f;
      --input-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      --radius-card: 28px;
      --radius-input: 12px;
      --radius-btn: 14px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Blobs */
    .blob {
      position: fixed; z-index: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      opacity: 0.55;
      animation: blobFloat 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .blob-1 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #f97316; top: -120px; left: -100px; }
    .blob-2 { width: 360px; height: 360px; background: #3b82f6; bottom: -80px; right: -80px; animation-delay: -6s; }
    .blob-3 { width: 260px; height: 260px; background: #ec4899; top: 38%; left: 58%; animation-delay: -12s; }
    @keyframes blobFloat {
      0%   { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      100% { transform: translate(40px, 30px) scale(1.08); }
    }

    .page-wrap {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      width: 100%; max-width: 440px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Logo */
    .logo-area {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }
    .logo-mark {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      background: var(--text-main);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .logo-text {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.4px; color: #fff;
    }
    .logo-text span { color: var(--primary); }

    /* Card */
    .form-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 44px 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.28), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    }

    .form-header { margin-bottom: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .form-icon {
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      background: rgba(249,115,22,.12);
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .form-title {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.5px;
      margin-bottom: 7px; color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .form-subtitle { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; }

    /* Alerts */
    .alert {
      padding: 13px 16px; border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 13.5px; margin-bottom: 22px;
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .alert svg { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .alert-error   { background: rgba(220,38,38,.09);  border: 1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.2);  color: #c53030; }
    .alert-success { background: rgba(22,163,74,.09);  border: 1px solid rgba(22,163,74,.2);  color: #15803d; }

    .info-box {
      background: rgba(249,115,22,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(249,115,22,.2);
      border-radius: 12px; padding: 13px 16px;
      font-size: 13.5px; color: #92400e; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Fields */
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .form-label {
      display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 7px; color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .input-wrap { position: relative; }
    .input-icon {
      position: absolute; left: 15px; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: #9ca3af; pointer-events: none; display: flex; align-items: center;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .input-wrap:focus-within .input-icon { color: var(--primary); }
    .form-input {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
      border-radius: var(--radius-input); padding: 13px 14px 13px 46px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-main);
      outline: none; transition: all .2s;
    }
    .form-input::placeholder { color: #b0b0b0; }
    .form-input:focus {
      background: #fff; border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(249,115,22,.12);
    }

    /* Button */
    .btn-submit {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--text-main); color: #fff;
      border: none; border-radius: var(--radius-btn);
      padding: 15px 20px;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer; transition: all .25s;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover {
      background: #000; transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -6px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    }
    .btn-submit:active { transform: translateY(0); box-shadow: none; }

    /* Footer */
    .page-footer {
      text-align: center; margin-top: 22px;
    }
    .page-footer a {
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .page-footer a:hover { color: #fff; }

    @media (max-width: 480px) { .form-card { padding: 32px 24px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-2"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-3"></div>

  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <div class="logo-mark">B</div>
      <div class="logo-text">Biz<span>Flow</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card">
      <div class="form-header">
        <div class="form-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="form-title">ลืมรหัสผ่าน?</h2>
        <p class="form-subtitle">ระบุอีเมลของคุณ เราจะส่งลิงก์<br>สำหรับตั้งรหัสผ่านใหม่ให้ทันที</p>
      </div>

      <% if (error && error.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="alert alert-error">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        <%= error[0] %>
      </div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (success && success.length > 0) { %>
      <div class="alert alert-success">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
        <%= success[0] %>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box">
        ✉ ตรวจสอบกล่องจดหมายของคุณและคลิกลิงก์เพื่อรีเซตรหัสผ่าน (หมดอายุใน 1 ชั่วโมง)
      </div>
      <% } %>

      <form action="/forgot-password" method="POST">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">อีเมลของคุณ</label>
          <div class="input-wrap">
            <span class="input-icon">
              <svg width="17" height="17" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <input type="email" name="email" class="form-input" placeholder="name@company.com" required autofocus>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">ส่งลิงก์รีเซตรหัสผ่าน</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="page-footer">
      <a href="/login">
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        กลับไปหน้าเข้าสู่ระบบ
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
